SUMMARY:Earth Day at Iron Horse Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Earth Day at Ironhorse Vineyards. They are offering a special tour "Oysters &amp; Salmon Habitat Eco Tour" which starts with a glass of bubbly before. Learn how this effort strengthens the watershed before returning to enjoy freshly shucked Hog Island oysters paired with Estate Sparkling Wines\, including Ocean Reserve Blanc de Blancs\, which supports ocean conservation. This experience celebrates renewal\, stewardship\, and the connection between land\, water\, and wine. Space is limited to 36 guests.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/earth-day-at-iron-horse-vineyards/
LOCATION:9786 Ross Station Road, Sebastopol , CA, 95472, United States
GEO:-122.8988331;38.456117
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Dining,Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Food and Wine Pairing,Outdoors,Sonoma County,Wine
