SUMMARY:Healdsburg in Bloom at Villa Chanticleer
DESCRIPTION:Boys &amp; Girls Clubs of Sonoma-Marin hosts its annual dinner and auction\, Healdsburg in Bloom\, at the historic Villa Chanticleer. This elegant evening celebrates more than two decades of community impact and nearly 80 years of service to Healdsburg youth.    Guests will gather in support of after-school and summer programs that serve more than 400 local children\, helping great futures take root and flourish. The night features a world-class culinary experience by Troubadour Bread &amp; Bistro\, paired with exceptional local wines\, lively auctions\, and meaningful connections with others passionate about empowering young people.    Proceeds benefit programs that inspire and educate support local youth.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/healdsburg-in-bloom-at-villa-chanticleer/
LOCATION:900 Chanticleer Way, Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
GEO:-122.8486772;38.6217248
CATEGORIES:Auction,Benefit,Celebration,Food,Food & Wine,Food and Wine Pairing,Wine
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/01/18125212/25-04-Apr-GMF-Boys-and-Girls-Club-Big-Dreams-Start-Small-_F1I7042-Enhanced-NR-1.jpg
